flowchart LR
    A[detect_file_type] --> B[prepare_sources]
    B -->|usable chunks| C[build_source_index]
    B -->|rejected/error/no chunks| M[format]
    C --> D[extract]
    D --> E[dedupe_requirements]
    E --> F[retrieve_evidence]
    F --> G[classify]
    G --> H[evidence_grounding]
    H --> I[generate]
    I --> J[quality_gate]
    J -->|repairable and enabled| K[repair_stories]
    K --> J
    J -->|pass / disabled / exhausted| L[summarize]
    L --> M
